            "line": 181,
            "text": "theorem pressureSource_mass_zero {a b : ℝ} (hab : a < b) {f : Lift S → ℝ}\n    (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (hs : RadialAlias.RadiallySupported a b f) (s : S) :\n    pressureMass (pressureSource a b hab f) s = 0"
